---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import scratchBabyImg from '../assets/scratchbaby-screenshot-crop.png';
import InstallMoonbase from '../components/InstallMoonbase.astro';
---

<Layout title="Scratch Baby">
	<main class="product-page">
		<h1 class="sr-only">Scratch Baby</h1>

		<div class="screenshot-container">
			<img src="/scratchbabylogo.png" alt="" class="peek-logo" aria-hidden="true" />
			<div class="screenshot-wrapper">
				<Image
					src={scratchBabyImg}
					alt="Scratch Baby plugin interface showing waveform display, slice controls, and per-voice knobs"
					class="screenshot"
					loading="eager"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>

		<p class="product-tagline">Playable turntable inspired sampler</p>

		<div class="video-wrapper">
			<iframe
				src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/64azH-tCn2E"
				title="Scratch Baby demo"
				frameborder="0"
				allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
				allowfullscreen
			></iframe>
		</div>

		<div class="description">
			<p>
				Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vestibulum facilisis magna at ante tincidunt, vel scelerisque nulla luctus. Fusce vel metus at libero fermentum bibendum non sit amet risus. Praesent euismod sapien a urna volutpat, ac dictum eros consequat.
			</p>
			<p>
				Donec ultricies nunc nec felis tincidunt, a volutpat magna pharetra. Integer sit amet justo vel arcu sodales tincidunt. Nulla facilisi. Suspendisse potenti. Cras vehicula lorem id felis lacinia, non faucibus purus malesuada.
			</p>
			<p>
				Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas. Maecenas imperdiet lectus vel condimentum tincidunt. Sed non magna at nulla ultrices fringilla vel in purus.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="buttons">
			<button class="btn btn-purchase" onclick="Moonbase.add_to_cart({ product_id: 'scratch-baby', show_cart: true })">
				Purchase — <span data-moonbase-render="product.scratch-baby.price">TBD</span>
			</button>
			<button class="btn btn-trial" onclick="Moonbase.download_product({ product_id: 'scratch-baby' })">
				Download Trial
			</button>
		</div>
	</main>
	<InstallMoonbase/>
</Layout>

<style>
	.product-page {
		min-height: 100vh;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
		background:
			linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(45, 65, 80, 0.4) 0%, rgba(30, 50, 65, 0.6) 100%),
			url('/sky_background.jpg') center / cover no-repeat;
		background-color: #1e3241;
		font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
		color: #e8e0d4;
	}

	.sr-only {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		padding: 0;
		margin: -1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
		white-space: nowrap;
		border: 0;
	}

	.product-tagline {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: #f2a7c4;
		margin: 0 0 3rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.screenshot-container {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 900px;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.peek-logo {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 25%;
		left: 0;
		transform: translate(0%, 50%);
		width: 120px;
		height: auto;
		z-index: 0;
		transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
	}

	.screenshot-container:hover .peek-logo {
		transform: translate(-75%, 50%);
	}

	.screenshot-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		width: 100%;
		border-radius: 12px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 2px solid #1a2a35;
		box-shadow:
			4px 4px 0px #f2a7c4;
	}

	.screenshot {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
	}

	.video-wrapper {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 200px;
		aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 2px solid #1a2a35;
		box-shadow:
			4px 4px 0px #f2a7c4;
	}

	.video-wrapper iframe {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: none;
	}

	.description {
		max-width: 680px;
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.description p {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: #c8d4dc;
	}

	.buttons {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
	}

	.btn:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
	}

	.btn-purchase {
		background: #f2a7c4;
		color: #1a2a35;
	}

	.btn-purchase:hover {
		background: #f7bdd4;
	}

	.btn-trial {
		background: transparent;
		color: #f2a7c4;
		border: 2px solid #f2a7c4;
	}

	.btn-trial:hover {
		background: rgba(242, 167, 196, 0.1);
	}
</style>
